# 📝 To-Do List App

## 📖 Description

This is a simple and responsive To-Do List application built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The application allows users to manage daily tasks by adding, editing, completing, and deleting tasks. It also uses the browser's `localStorage` to save tasks so they remain available even after the page is refreshed.

This project was developed as part of the **IYF Weekend Academy Season 11 - Week 13 & 14 Assignment**, focusing on JavaScript best practices, code refactoring, application state management, and browser storage.

---

## 🚀 Features

- ➕ Add new tasks
- ✏️ Edit existing tasks
- ✅ Mark tasks as completed
- 🗑️ Delete tasks
- 💾 Save tasks using `localStorage`
- 🔄 Automatically load saved tasks after refreshing the page
- ⌨️ Press **Enter** to add a task
- 📱 Clean and responsive user interface

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)
- Browser Local Storage

